Sources and changes:

- references/commands.md: from skills/chrome-devtools-cli/SKILL.md; reorganized
  by category and checked against the 1.12.0 `--help` output.
- references/performance.md: from skills/debug-optimize-lcp (SKILL.md and
  references/); condensed and rewritten for CLI syntax.
- references/network-cookies.md: from skills/cookie-debugging/SKILL.md; rewritten
  for CLI syntax.
- references/accessibility.md: from skills/a11y-debugging (SKILL.md and
  references/a11y-snippets.md); rewritten for CLI syntax.
- references/memory.md: from skills/memory-leak-debugging (SKILL.md and
  references/common-leaks.md); rewritten for CLI syntax.
- references/troubleshooting.md: from skills/troubleshooting/SKILL.md and
  docs/troubleshooting.md; MCP configuration steps replaced by CLI daemon
  diagnostics.

In every adapted file, MCP tool calls were replaced by `chrome-devtools` commands
and references to MCP configuration files were removed.
